- id: M-2025-10-26-03
  title: Love Story Narrative
  tags: [ceremony, story, tone]
  date: 2025-10-26
  confidence: 0.98
  type: note
  content: |
    Every love story starts somewhere — sometimes it’s chance, sometimes it’s a swipe, and sometimes ... it’s a voice memo about making a hundred dumplings.

    Phill heard Estefania’s voice for the first time online, describing her perfect Sunday — and that was all it took.

    When they finally met at Le Tub — yes, the restaurant with the bathroom theme — Estefania was nervous, but Phill was calm and kind. They talked by the water, ate terrible food, and laughed until the nerves melted away.

    That day set the tone for everything that came after: laughter, curiosity, balance, and an easy rhythm that just felt right.

    If you’ve spent any time with these two, you know their love doesn’t need to be loud — it’s steady, warm, and full of laughter.

    Phill brings calm and thoughtfulness; Nia brings creativity, confidence, and spark. Together they’ve built a life that’s joyful and grounded — filled with inside jokes, puns, late-night talks, and shared adventures big and small.

    That’s the beauty of their love — it feels like home and discovery all at once.

